0 FILE 10183 - 11 - German Standard Electric Locomotive.ldr
0 German Standard Electric Locomotive: a red, dark-bluish-grey and black LEGO train built on a 6x24 base, with a cab/nose at each end (yellow headlights at the front, red tail lights at the rear), glazed side windows with glass and door rails, a sloped ventilated roof with grille tiles, brick-built mechanical piston-and-rod linkage details, two clip-and-ladder side details, and two powered wheel bogies fitted with buffers, couplings and magnets
0 Name: 10183 - 11 - German Standard Electric Locomotive.ldr
0 Author: Bert Van Raemdonck [BEAVeR]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0 : see CAreadme.txt
